  book_title: Neck and Shoulder Relief Guide
  book_color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  book_clue_index: -1
  content: 
  clue_content: 'Been Sitting Too Long? Try This Quick Neck and Shoulder Relaxation
    Tip!

    1. Sit upright with your arms relaxed.

    2. Slowly lift your shoulders
    toward your ears.

    3. Roll them backward, gently drawing your shoulder blades
    together.

    4. Lower your shoulders and relax. Repeat 5 times.'
